kopi-beans
===================

This crate (the `bn` CLI) is a single-crate collapse of the former multi-crate
`kopitiam-bds` fork. The former top package and its nine sub-crates (beads-core,
beads-api, beads-bootstrap, beads-surface, beads-macros, beads-cli, beads-git,
beads-daemon, beads-daemon-core) are now the intra-crate modules
core/api/bootstrap/surface/macros/cli_surface/git/daemon/daemon_core within this
one crate; the binary is renamed `bd` -> `bn`. The whole thing is a FORK of:

