    Licensed under the MIT License

Forked from upstream commit:

    d98da231d068acbadcdcd2262971c561de86132b
    ("Fix IpcError design to hide crates and expose states (#99)", 2026-05-27)
    which is the `main` HEAD at fork time; it post-dates the tagged v0.1.26 and
